  "title": "Juicy Light Southern Thai Shrimp Som Tum",
  "description": "A winey and pillowy Southern Thai dish featuring shrimp stock, with an al-dente finish, made in a cataplana vessel, som tum style, and friendly to Mediterranean tastes.",
