  "instructions": [
    "Heat the cataplana sauce in the cataplana vessel over medium heat.",
    "Add the shrimp and cook until they are pink and just done.",
    "Remove the shrimp from the vessel and set them aside.",
    "Add the fish sauce, lime juice, and palm sugar to the vessel and stir to combine.",
    "Add the chilies, garlic, and lemon grass to the vessel and cook for 1 minute.",
    "Add the shrimp stock to the vessel and bring to a boil.",
    "Reduce the heat to low and simmer for 5 minutes.",
    "Add the cooked shrimp back to the vessel and stir to combine.",
    "Stir in the chopped basil and serve immediately."
  ],
